(38, '5d20a4a4-87a7-41d7-ae67-25161ebfb212', 'database', 'default', '{\"uuid\":\"5d20a4a4-87a7-41d7-ae67-25161ebfb212\",\"displayName\":\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\ImportAnimeJob\",\"job\":\"Illuminate\\\\Queue\\\\CallQueuedHandler@call\",\"maxTries\":3,\"maxExceptions\":null,\"failOnTimeout\":false,\"backoff\":null,\"timeout\":120,\"retryUntil\":null,\"data\":{\"commandName\":\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\ImportAnimeJob\",\"command\":\"O:23:\\\"App\\\\Jobs\\\\ImportAnimeJob\\\":2:{s:9:\\\"animeData\\\";a:21:{s:6:\\\"mal_id\\\";i:27;s:5:\\\"title\\\";s:13:\\\"Trinity Blood\\\";s:14:\\\"title_japanese\\\";s:30:\\\"トリニティ・ブラッド\\\";s:4:\\\"slug\\\";N;s:11:\\\"description\\\";s:1248:\\\"Following Armageddon, an apocalyptic war, mankind faces yet another menace: vampires. The continuous confrontations between the races have split the world into separate factions. The race of vampires, Methuselah, are affiliated with the New Human Empire; whereas the humans, deemed Terrans by the vampires, make up the Vatican Papal State. Furthermore, extremist groups like the Rosenkreuz Order strive to rekindle a war, despite the factions\' attempts to avoid direct conflict.\\n\\nTo combat terrorist organizations, the Vatican has implemented the AX unit. Led by Cardinal Caterina Sforza, the AX agents investigate vampire-related disturbances with hopes that the Terrans and the Methuselah will one day achieve peaceful coexistence. Amongst the AX unit is priest Abel Nightroad—a seemingly disoriented but gentle-hearted fellow who is a fierce vampire slayer on the battlefield. Joining the unit as his partner is agent Sister Esther Blanchett, a brave and gentle young nun troubled with a tragic past. \\n\\nAs the two grow closer, they begin to uncover signs of malicious schemes and dark forces working in the shadows. But the path they walk is riddled with misfortune that might just force them to confront the memories that plague their hearts.\\\";s:4:\\\"type\\\";s:2:\\\"TV\\\";s:6:\\\"status\\\";s:9:\\\"Completed\\\";s:7:\\\"country\\\";s:2:\\\"JP\\\";s:6:\\\"season\\\";s:6:\\\"Spring\\\";s:4:\\\"year\\\";i:2005;s:6:\\\"rating\\\";s:30:\\\"R - 17+ (violence & profanity)\\\";s:5:\\\"score\\\";d:7.3;s:14:\\\"episodes_count\\\";i:24;s:8:\\\"duration\\\";i:24;s:6:\\\"source\\\";s:11:\\\"Light novel\\\";s:6:\\\"studio\\\";s:5:\\\"Gonzo\\\";s:9:\\\"producers\\\";s:0:\\\"\\\";s:9:\\\"licensors\\\";s:10:\\\"Funimation\\\";s:9:\\\"thumbnail\\\";s:50:\\\"https:\\/\\/myanimelist.net\\/images\\/anime\\/10\\/24649l.jpg\\\";s:6:\\\"banner\\\";s:50:\\\"https:\\/\\/myanimelist.net\\/images\\/anime\\/10\\/24649l.jpg\\\";s:6:\\\"genres\\\";a:3:{i:0;a:2:{s:6:\\\"mal_id\\\";i:1;s:4:\\\"name\\\";s:6:\\\"Action\\\";}i:1;a:2:{s:6:\\\"mal_id\\\";i:10;s:4:\\\"name\\\";s:7:\\\"Fantasy\\\";}i:2;a:2:{s:6:\\\"mal_id\\\";i:24;s:4:\\\"name\\\";s:6:\\\"Sci-Fi\\\";}}}s:13:\\\"fetchEpisodes\\\";b:0;}\"}}', 'PDOException: SQLSTATE[22007]: Invalid datetime format: 1366 Incorrect decimal value: \'R - 17+ (violence & profanity)\' for column `aniwaves`.`anime`.`rating` at row 1 in C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\anime\\vendor\\laravel\\framework\\src\\Illuminate\\Database\\MySqlConnection.php:53\nStack trace:\n#0 C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\anime\\vendor\\laravel\\framework\\src\\Illuminate\\Database\\MySqlConnection.php(53): PDOStatement->execute()\n#1 C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\anime\\vendor\\laravel\\framework\\src\\Illuminate\\Database\\Connection.php(812): Illuminate\\Database\\MySqlConnection->Illuminate\\Database\\{closure}(\'insert into `an...\', Array)\n#2 C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\anime\\vendor\\laravel\\framework\\src\\Illuminate\\Database\\Connection.php(779): Illuminate\\Database\\Connection->runQueryCallback(\'insert into `an...\', Array, Object(Closure))\n#3 C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\anime\\vendor\\laravel\\framework\\src\\Illuminate\\Database\\MySqlConnection.php(42): Illuminate\\Database\\Connection->run(\'insert into `an...\', Array, Object(Closure))\n#4 C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\anime\\vendor\\laravel\\framework\\src\\Illuminate\\Database\\Query\\P